  "solution": {
    "text": "The equlvalent circuit for the given electrical network is <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2013_phy_a34.png\">\r\n\r\nThis is a balanced Wheatstone bridge, so the arm containing $2 r$ not in use. So, we have<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2013_phy_a34a.png\">\r\n\r\nSo, the equivalent resistance between a and bis\r\n$$\r\n\\frac{1}{r^{\\prime}}=\\frac{1}{2 r}+\\frac{1}{2 r} \\Rightarrow r^{\\prime}=\\frac{2 r}{2}=r\r\n$$",
